Phase 1 — manifold solver: test-bidirectionality verification log
Ticket #3 (epic #2). Worktree: .worktrees/phase-1.0 (branch feature/phase-1.0).
Date: 2026-08-03

Method (workflow test-bidirectionality rule): for each behaviour class, confirm
the suite is GREEN (PASS), then break the specific production line that
implements the behaviour (sed), run the named referencing test and observe a
GENUINE, class-specific vitest FAIL (not a compile error, not an unrelated
assertion), then restore (git checkout) and re-green. A test that cannot be made
to fail by breaking its behaviour is not testing that behaviour.

Baseline: `npm test` → 98 passed (98)  [70 Fraction + 28 manifold]  ✓ PASS
Final:    `npm test` → 98 passed (98)  ✓ PASS   (working tree clean after all restores)

