Production line (manifold.ts:292):  const k = toIndex(D.ceilDiv(B));
Break:  D.ceilDiv(B) → D.floorDiv(B)   (k = floor(600/480) = 1 instead of 2)
Referencing test: "20-smelter worked example: k=2, belts [480, 120@after-16]"

GENUINE FAIL:
  × 20-smelter worked example: k=2, belts [480, 120@after-16]
  FAIL  solveFeedLane — combination + entries + segments (spec row 1)
  AssertionError: expected [ { index: +0, …(3) } ] to have a length of 2 but got 1

Restored → GREEN.

